keymasq (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Normalize the packaged desktop application identity to lowercase
    tools.keymasq.keymasq across the GTK app ID, desktop ID, AppStream
    launchable entry, and icon namespace.
  * Update generated package outputs, post-install hooks, and smoke checks
    to use the lowercase desktop asset names consistently.
  * Keep the installed launcher and About dialog icon metadata aligned with
    the shipped lowercase application identity.

 -- nyrda <nyrda@keymasq.tools>  Fri, 17 Apr 2026 01:29:41 +0000

keymasq (0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add first-class Niri compositor support, including direct action dispatch.
  * Expand superkeys into pattern and overload modes with stricter validation.
  * Make superkey bindings value-aware so wheel directions and similar inputs map cleanly.
  * Split stable tagged releases from manual prerelease packaging.

 -- nyrda <nyrda@keymasq.tools>  Fri, 10 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000

